### Extensao "REST Client" (VS Code) ou cliente HTTP do Rider / Visual Studio.
### Suba a API antes:  dotnet run --project src/Triangulos.Api --urls http://localhost:5000

@host = http://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Classificar (GET) - triangulo 3,4,5
GET {{host}}/api/triangulos/classificar?a=3&b=4&c=5

### Classificar - experimente outras entradas!
GET {{host}}/api/triangulos/classificar?a=5&b=3&c=5

### Analisar (POST) - analise completa
POST {{host}}/api/triangulos/analisar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "a": 3, "b": 4, "c": 5 }

### Analisar - outro triangulo
POST {{host}}/api/triangulos/analisar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "a": 2, "b": 3, "c": 4 }

### 0-0-0 (esperado NaoEhTriangulo)
GET {{host}}/api/triangulos/classificar?a=0&b=0&c=0

### 0-3-3 (esperado NaoEhTriangulo)
GET {{host}}/api/triangulos/classificar?a=0&b=3&c=3

### -1-2-2 (esperado NaoEhTriangulo)
GET {{host}}/api/triangulos/classificar?a=-1&b=2&c=2

### NaN (esperado NaoEhTriangulo)
GET {{host}}/api/triangulos/classificar?a=NaN&b=1&c=1

### Infinity (esperado NaoEhTriangulo)
GET {{host}}/api/triangulos/classificar?a=Infinity&b=1&c=1

### POST 3-4-5 em outras posicoes: 4-5-3
POST {{host}}/api/triangulos/analisar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "a": 4, "b": 5, "c": 3 }
